ARTICLE 3: CONTRACT PRICE AND PAYMENT

3.1 The total contract price for the full contract period shall be Sixty Million Naira (₦60,000,000.00) only, inclusive of all taxes and levies. This sum shall be the entire consideration payable to the Contractor for the Services, and no additional payment shall be made unless expressly agreed in writing by the Board pursuant to a duly executed change request.

3.2 Payment shall be made quarterly in arrears upon submission of a certified invoice accompanied by a progress report and such supporting documentation as the Board may reasonably require.

3.3 The Board shall effect payment within thirty (30) working days of certification of the invoice by the Programme Manager and the Director of Finance.

3.4 All payments shall be subject to the deduction of withholding tax at the applicable rate and remitted to the relevant tax authority as required by law.

3.5 The Contractor shall submit its first invoice no earlier than 30 June 2024.

ARTICLE 4: TERM AND COMMENCEMENT

4.1 This Contract shall be effective from 1 April 2024 and shall remain in force until 31 March 2026, unless earlier terminated in accordance with Article 12.
